> **SELF-EXCLUSION.** Qoder Sonus is a real built-in model (Alibaba's Qoder agent
> platform, launched 2026-09-10) but it is subscription/credit-only with **no
> public API, no open weights, no published architecture, and no published
> benchmark table**. No independent harness (Artificial Analysis, Vals, BenchLM,
> LLM-Stats, SWE-bench leaderboards) carries a Sonus row. Only launch coverage and
> credit-promotion posts exist, plus community complaints about runaway credit
> consumption. Zero verified benchmark numbers → no scored file.

## Model card (verified facts only)

- **Name:** Qoder Sonus
- **Short description:** Alibaba Qoder's in-house built-in agent model (Sept 2026) for marathon-length autonomous tasks and computer use, driving desktop apps and pro software directly (coding, financial modeling, research, spreadsheets). Not a separately purchasable API model.
- **Provider / access:** Qoder (Alibaba) — built into Qoder, Qoder IDE, Qoder CLI, the JetBrains plugin, QoderWake, and Cloud Agents. Credit multiplier 3.2x; gated to Qoder subscriptions. No model API ID published; no OpenCode Zen ID.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-10. Knowledge cutoff not disclosed.
- **IDs:** none published (internal Qoder model picker entry only).
- **Context window:** Not announced (undisclosed).
- **Modalities:** Not officially itemised; Qoder Computer Use Agent implies screen (image) understanding + text; text out claimed.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-30):** No per-token price. Consumed via Qoder credits (3.2x multiplier); promotional daily credit packs (500 → 1,000 → 4,000/day) ran Sep 2026 and ended 2026-09-26.
- **Architecture:** Undisclosed (Qoder, no parameter count, no weights). Sibling built-in model: Cantus (also 3.2x).

