### Why the file is excluded (evidence trail)

- Official Qoder Forum launch post (2026-09-10) and Qoder X account describe capability only — no benchmark table.
- BenchLM, LLM-Stats, Artificial Analysis, Vals AI and SWE-bench leaderboards have no `sonus`/`qoder-sonus` row.
- Coverage found is launch wire news (bit.fan, AGI Hunt, MyTokenCap, lookonchain) plus credit-promotion pages; community posts report runaway credit burn, not scores.
- Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md` / `.agents/rules.md`, zero verified benchmarks → self-exclusion; no placeholder score invented.
- Re-research trigger: a vendor or independent benchmark row for Qoder Sonus → write a scored file and retire this twin.

